Rejection, war, taking over the world.. those things don't strike me as 
very positive and certainly aren't things I'd want to be associated with.
Why is it that every story needs war in it? It's not as if positive 
topics were boring, you know?
I always thought of the Lojban community as being very friendly and 
welcoming, but all this just sounds very negative, not to mention you 
seem to want this to be for children. I don't see why we should expose 
children to war, fighting, rebellions, hatred, etc. Instead, why not 
focus on ... Love and Tolerance?

